278
00:10:51,940 --> 00:10:54,760
They would die for them?

279
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:56,200
All right, so anyway, we had a paper

280
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:58,360
in the Review of Austrian Economics developing this.

281
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:01,440
But in the real world, we say that they're that.

