00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:10,720
in the real world, they actually are not symmetric.

285
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,840
Questions about that?

286
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:18,760
In that case, let's return to coordination.

287
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,640
And again, so let me just remind you

288
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:22,680
that you're all full of energy.

289
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:25,360
And the fact that class is approaching

