since that's what we all want.

296
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,480
That's what we will all do.

297
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,920
Eventually, I will get to the point

298
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:46,680
where I will make people chant and cheer.

